    "text": "Meet Déjà View, a model that turns photos taken from different angles into 3D geometry and camera positions.\n\nBy looping a single transformer block, this 117M-parameter model matches or outperforms models up to 10x larger across five benchmarks, using comparable or less compute. Researchers can dial the number of loops to fit their compute budget.\n\n#NeurIPS2026 oral paper + code: https://t.co/4jiCRA71Oo",
